<p>Evans, Charles L., 2012, &ldquo;Some thoughts on global risks and monetary policy,&rdquo; <a title="speech" href="/publications/speeches/2012/08-27-12-hongkong">speech</a>, Market News International seminar, Hong Kong, China, August 27.</p>

<p>Werning, Ivan, 2011, &ldquo;Managing a liquidity trap: Monetary and fiscal policy,&rdquo; National Bureau of Economic Research, working paper, No. 17344, August.</p>

